  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrating Active Ageing in Public Policies in the Republic of Moldova</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Monitoring the implementation of existing socio-economic policies relevant to ageing;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2. Integrating the needs of older women and men in the emerging policies through policy analysis</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">3. Supporting realization of social protection needs of older women and men in three communities of Moldova</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Platform on Active Ageing aims to increase access of older women and men to healthcare and medicines and ensure a better social protection through mainstreaming ageing into public policies relevant to older people.</narrative>
  </description>
